1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Be7 4. O-O Nf6 5. Nc3 d6 6. d4 O-O 7. d5 Nb8 8. Ne1
a6 9. f4 b5 10. Be2 b4 11. Nb1 Nxe4 12. Bf3 Nf6 13. fxe5 Ne8 $2 (13... dxe5 14.
d6 Bxd6 15. Bxa8 $2 Bc5+ {wins the queen}) 14. c4 c5 15. Nd3 Bb7 16. Bg4 dxe5
17. Nxe5 Bf6 18. Qe2 Nd6 19. Nd2 Re8 20. Ndf3 Nd7 21. Bxd7 {"At this stage the
game was adjudicated by Mr Bird in favour of White." Source: Chess-Monthly,
1886, p238} (21. Bxd7 Qxd7 22. Nxd7 Rxe2 23. Nxf6+ gxf6 24. b3 {followed by
Rf2, Bb2 and Kf1 is the winning line given in Chess-Monthly.}) 1-0

